# Copy to .env for local development. .env is gitignored.

# Where the hub lives. This is the only setting the parent app has, and with
# nothing here every screen says so rather than failing: `isConfigured` is
# false and no request is made.
#
# Release builds accept https only, for the same reason the child app does —
# a bearer token over plain http is a bearer token anyone on the wifi has.
# Development builds also accept http, so the app can run against a laptop:
#
#   http://localhost:8099   in the browser
#   http://10.0.2.2:8099    on the Android emulator, rewritten automatically
#                           from localhost by src/api/host.ts
EXPO_PUBLIC_HUB_URL=
